            "quote": "Being sensitive to chemical perfumes, alcohol sprays give me headaches. Salma is 100% pure and gentle on my neck. The dewy Mogra and cashmere musk dry-down feels like royal Kannauj royalty.",
            "author": "Ananya Sengupta",
            "location": "Bengaluru",
            "longevity_tag": "Skin Safe & Pure"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "perfume": "Bakhoor Luxury Attar",
            "headline": "Incense smoke & oud that commands the room.",
            "quote": "Bakhoor smells like an ancient Arabian palace courtyard. Deep frankincense and smoldering agarwood. Even after washing my kurta, a faint royal sillage remained. Outstanding packaging too.",
